 s:tampa.govADARequest. (https:tampa.govADARequest.) For additional informa
 tion\, please contact City Council Attorney Martin Shelby at Martin.Shelby
 tampa.gov or 813-274-7719. \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/19305
 6
